{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command armies, build strategies, and dominate the battlefield!</strong><br>In this real-time strategy game, you take the role of commander and control every move of your soldiers. Select troops, organize formations, and give precise orders to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/bd0a8e9bd54fe0b094bc953bd905077b.poster.avif?t=1757526630\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/bd0a8e9bd54fe0b094bc953bd905077b.webm?t=1757526630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/bd0a8e9bd54fe0b094bc953bd905077b.mp4?t=1757526630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can decide where they should move, target specific enemies, or even distribute attacks automatically, ensuring no enemy is left standing. Every order can determine victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/28254120aa24463a0c8c915ff75a2f36.poster.avif?t=1757526630\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/28254120aa24463a0c8c915ff75a2f36.webm?t=1757526630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/28254120aa24463a0c8c915ff75a2f36.mp4?t=1757526630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign:</strong> progress through campaigns made of 5 unique rounds, each bringing tougher challenges and more strategic enemies. Survive all rounds to claim the final victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox:</strong> unleash your creativity. Choose the soldiers, place them wherever you want, and create epic scenarios \u2014 from balanced encounters to absolute chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/e8c63f15054d189b70bfecba20f881cc.poster.avif?t=1757526630\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/e8c63f15054d189b70bfecba20f881cc.webm?t=1757526630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/e8c63f15054d189b70bfecba20f881cc.mp4?t=1757526630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full control of soldiers: single or multiple selection, movement, and strategic attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive campaign system with challenging rounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode for custom battles and experimentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different units, each with unique behaviors and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic atmosphere with music that shifts between calm moments and intense battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006170?t=1757526630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006170?t=1757526630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/b07c852c813a368560bf4632f7074d5cff717fdc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757526630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/b07c852c813a368560bf4632f7074d5cff717fdc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757526630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command armies, build strategies, and dominate the battlefield!</strong><br>In this real-time strategy game, you take the role of commander and control every move of your soldiers. Select troops, organize formations, and give precise orders to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/bd0a8e9bd54fe0b094bc953bd905077b.poster.avif?t=1757526630\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/bd0a8e9bd54fe0b094bc953bd905077b.webm?t=1757526630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006170/extras/bd0a8e9bd54fe0b094bc953bd905077b.mp4?t=1757526630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can decide where they should move, target specific enemies, or even distribute attacks automatically, ensuring no enemy is left standing. Every order can determine victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor